{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Subliminal&quot; is a first-person software raytraced horror/puzzle game inspired by the concept of the &quot;Backrooms.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by your conscious, venture deep into your mind and relive some of your most treasured and sacred core memories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/9f6e016d8d94bd1118ed0dc46d4eb4b0.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine 5, <br>&quot;Subliminal&quot; features cutting-edge lighting and rendering technology, (including Lumen and Nanite) with incredibly realistic and detailed environments, models, geometry, lighting and shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As you progress further into your memories, be please careful and make sure to stay focused...&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/f37d3083c7bdbadec89e8e63d2a3936e.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/68d0103489141c56df8326dbd2d340be.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Subliminal&quot; features handcrafted nostalgia based levels all connected through a winding, <br>non-linear series of story paths &amp; endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/1bd98b56a42a80a7a45cf534a1182472.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/03dbdd05a296254565fa510c185bddd2.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve perspective and light-based puzzles as you continue through your mind, <br>using your environment, surroundings, and nearby lights, and shadows to solve puzzles and progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Occasionally you may come face to face with manifestations of fear and despair, but not to worry, as I your conscious am here to guide you through any tricky situations you might find yourself in...&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/f76e5919cdb454d3bfd25557506e757b.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/c819713a6f93f1e4bc0ab9cdc50f2555.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300840/extras/b680bf4a304266c0b33736095ab0f74d.avif?t=1759104585\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>","backgro